# SANITISED for the estate source-of-truth repo.
#
# The copy taken from sites/garter-black-v3 (commit 5f8b6df) carried a real
# roster gate password on the ROSTER_PASSWORD line. A credential is a secret
# regardless of the filename or the "example" suffix, so it was replaced here
# with placeholders. The value is not recoverable from this repo; it belongs in
# Cloudflare (`wrangler pages secret put ROSTER_PASSWORD --project-name
# garter-black`) and the operator's own store.
#
# The upstream repo still holds the real value and still needs fixing there.
# See decisions/garter-black.md, section "Sanitisation performed".
SESSION_SECRET=replace-me-local-only
ROSTER_PASSWORD=replace-me-local-only
AI_TOKEN=replace-me-local-only